    "text": "Let $P=\\left[a_{i j}\\right]$ be a $3 \\times 3$ matrix and let $Q=\\left[b_{i j}\\right]$, where $b_{i j}=2^{i+j} a_{i j}$ for $1 \\leq i, j \\leq 3$. If the determinant of $P$ is 2 , then the determinant of the matrix $Q$ is",
    "image": null
  },
